SUMMARY:Healdsburg Wine &amp; Food Experience
DESCRIPTION:Set in the heart of California wine country\, the Healdsburg Wine &amp; Food Experience is a weekend-long celebration of Sonoma County’s finest food\, wine\, and artisans. The festival spotlights the region’s farmers\, growers\, winemakers\, and chefs alongside globally acclaimed wines from the world’s top regions.    Explore Sonoma’s rich culinary diversity\, sustainable farming\, and deep agricultural heritage\, connecting local traditions with global flavors. Healdsburg itself offers a vibrant backdrop\, with acclaimed restaurants\, tasting rooms\, art galleries\, and specialty shops. Nestled along the Russian River\, the town is surrounded by scenic vineyards and stunning vistas\, offering a blend of award-winning varietals to delight every palate. 
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/healdsburg-wine-food-experience/
LOCATION:Various, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.8607632;38.6364375
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Drink,Featured Food & Wine Events,Food,Food & Wine,Food & Wine Festivals,Sonoma County,Wine,Wine Festivals
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2023/03/10005056/HFWE-500x500-1.jpg
