SUMMARY:Soul Fuse at The California Theatre of Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:Soul Fuse brings a nine-piece wall of soul\, funk\, and R&amp;B to The California Theatre of Santa Rosa. The band features musicians who have shared stages with Loggins and Messina\, The Eagles\, and Gregg Allman. Together they mix original compositions with classic grooves that have kept Sonoma County dance floors full for more than a decade.  The show runs from 7:30 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. on Saturday\, May 16\, 2026. Advance tickets are $15 and tickets at the door are $22. Expect a night of live soul music in downtown Santa Rosa\, with horns\, rhythm\, and chemistry that sit somewhere between a concert and a dance party.        Visit WebsiteEvent Tickets  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/soul-fuse-at-the-california-theatre-of-santa-rosa/
LOCATION:528 7th Street, Santa Rosa, CA, 95401, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/14081815/soul-fuse.jpg
END:VEVENT
