SUMMARY:Matsuri! Japanese Arts Festival at Juilliard Park
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Japanese arts and culture at Juilliard Park in Santa Rosa with live taiko drumming\, folk dance\, martial arts\, and traditional mochi pounding. This year features a special Sumo demonstration by Honu Sumo from San Diego. Enjoy cultural exhibits\, art\, clothing\, authentic cuisine\, origami\, a Japanese language booth\, and hands-on activities for kids. Free and fun for all ages!
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/matsuri-japanese-arts-festival-at-juilliard-park-2/
LOCATION:227 Santa Rosa Ave, Santa Rosa, CA, 95401, United States
GEO:-122.713722;38.435203
