SUMMARY:Bubbles &amp; Beignets at J Vineyards &amp; Winery
DESCRIPTION:Bubbles &amp; Beignets at J Vineyards brings a taste of New Orleans to wine country. Enjoy freshly made beignets paired with your favorite J sparkling wines while relaxing on the scenic Terrace. This lively experience blends sweet treats\, bubbles\, and a festive atmosphere\, perfect for a fun and flavorful day at the winery.
