SUMMARY:Ronstadt Revolution at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Experience a heartfelt tribute to Linda Ronstadt at The California Theatre with Ronstadt Revolution\, Northern California’s premier homage to the 11-time Grammy winner. Led by acclaimed vocalist Natalie Amaya\, the band features seasoned musicians who have performed alongside legends like Elvis Presley\, Tina Turner\, and Sheryl Crow.    Together\, they bring Ronstadt’s iconic catalog to life with authenticity and soul\, celebrating both her English and Spanish-language hits. Audiences can enjoy favorites like “Heat Wave\,” “You’re No Good\,” “Blue Bayou\,” and “Tu Solo Tu\,” performed with passion and precision.    This dynamic live show offers a joyful journey through the timeless music that defined a generation.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/ronstadt-revolution-at-the-california-theatre/
LOCATION:528 7th Street, Santa Rosa, CA, 95401, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/07225514/09e97f_c9ca4dab4ba641448988dba76a1bc219mv2.png
END:VEVENT
